# Offline pin notes — gpw-mbd-kpoint-forces

## Policy

CP2K 2026.1 stock `PAIR_POTENTIAL TYPE` has **no MBD**. Oracle is **libMBD**
(energy) + **force dual-gate** + **multi-k product wiring** (same policy as
`gpw-mbd-forces` / `gpw-mbd-ice`).

## Residual closed

Multi-k `assemble_gpw_forces_kpoints` previously counted `mbd` for mutual
exclusion but skipped adding \(F_{\mathrm{MBD}}\). Product path now matches Γ.

