### H₂ multi-k wiring

- Cell 12³ Bohr, k-mesh 1×1×2, PADE + DZV-GTH-PADE, bond 1.0 Bohr.
- `mbd=true`, free-atom (default `mbd_k_mesh={0,0,0}`).
- Gate: \(F^{k+\mathrm{MBD}}-F^{k}\approx F_{\mathrm{MBD}}^{\mathrm{geom}}\) to 1e-8 Ha/Bohr.
